{"D:\\wt\\lou8\\vlog\\lou8\\voz\\b012_t3.wav": {"text": "and slowly, a whole generation forgot that pancakes are five things in a bowl. My mother never bought a box in her life. She'd have laughed at it. I'll tell you one more thing. On the last Sunday before I closed my diner, I made the batter Saturday night like always. 212 pancakes that morning. The last plate went to an old trucker who'd been coming in for 30 years. He ate the whole stack, wiped his mouth, and said, Lou, I never once had a bad pancake here. That's all a cook ever wants to hear. So here's your homework. This Sunday, make the batter. The night before, if you can. Two bowls, a fork, lumps, a hot griddle wiped clean, and one flip. Make a stack for somebody you love. Then come down to the comments and tell me how tall it was and what your family put on top. Syrup, butter, peanut butter, I've heard everything. I read every one of them.", "words": [{"w": " and", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.18}, {"w": " slowly,", "s": 0.18, "e": 0.7}, {"w": " a", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.4}, {"w": " whole", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.82}, {"w": " generation", "s": 1.82, "e": 2.5}, {"w": " forgot", "s": 2.5, "e": 2.94}, {"w": " that", "s": 2.94, "e": 3.36}, {"w": " pancakes", "s": 3.36, "e": 3.94}, {"w": " are", "s": 3.94, "e": 4.22}, {"w": " five", "s": 4.22, "e": 4.68}, {"w": " things", "s": 4.68, "e": 5.14}, {"w": " in", "s": 5.14, "e": 5.36}, {"w": " a", "s": 5.36, "e": 5.5}, {"w": " bowl.", "s": 5.5, "e": 6.3}, {"w": " My", "s": 6.52, "e": 6.7}, {"w": " mother", "s": 6.7, "e": 7.1}, {"w": " never", "s": 7.1, "e": 7.58}, {"w": " bought", "s": 7.58, "e": 7.9}, {"w": " a", "s": 7.9, "e": 8.08}, {"w": " box", "s": 8.08, "e": 8.38}, {"w": " in", "s": 8.38, "e": 8.56}, {"w": " her", "s": 8.56, "e": 8.72}, {"w": " life.", "s": 8.72, "e": 9.54}, {"w": " She'd", "s": 9.52, "e": 9.78}, {"w": " have", "s": 9.78, "e": 9.88}, {"w": " laughed", "s": 9.88, "e": 10.28}, {"w": " at", "s": 10.28, "e": 10.52}, {"w": " it.", "s": 10.52, "e": 11.12}, {"w": " I'll"